# Sources the guides excerpt. The repository style applies, except that a call
# which does not fit in 100 columns puts every argument on its own line instead
# of bin-packing them, and the right-hand side of an assignment starts on the
# `=` line with the chained calls under it (doc/principal/dev/source-formatting.ko.md).
BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig
BinPackArguments: false
PenaltyBreakAssignment: 1000
